  id: IGotLost'sBrother
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 12f25f1d96117864989291e5ec64d2b8, type: 2}
    text: Hey! Did you by any chance you stumbled across a lost person
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: 1
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 0
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 12f25f1d96117864989291e5ec64d2b8, type: 2}
    text: I lost my brother when the goblin raided our house. He fled and i couldn't
      find him.
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: 2
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 0
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 12f25f1d96117864989291e5ec64d2b8, type: 2}
    text: He is a shy person he will not say his name. Say i met your brother Tony
      and he is very worried.
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: 3
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 0
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 12f25f1d96117864989291e5ec64d2b8, type: 2}
    text: Find my brother Frank! and meet me.
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1bc8ec8064a16164cb2bfd960a451764, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: e58537cf7b2e59b468dd20e95e3558b9, type: 2}
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: 4
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 3
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 12f25f1d96117864989291e5ec64d2b8, type: 2}
    text: For your help have this, I stole it from the goblins.
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: 5
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 0
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 12f25f1d96117864989291e5ec64d2b8, type: 2}
    text: Thank you so much for help once again.
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards:
    - quantity: 5
